Create configurable salary components.

Examples:

```text
Basic Salary
HRA
Conveyance
Special Allowance
Medical Allowance
Transport Allowance
Performance Bonus
Attendance Bonus
Overtime
Incentive
Commission
Other Earnings
```

Deductions:

