# 74. IDOR PROTECTION

Test:

```text
GET /api/v1/payroll/OTHER_EMPLOYEE
```

and:

```text
GET /api/v1/payslips/OTHER_EMPLOYEE
```

Must return unauthorized/not found according to API security policy.

