# 75. MASS ASSIGNMENT PROTECTION

Do not allow clients to set:

```text
tenant_id
approved_by
payroll_status
net_salary
gross_salary
created_by
```

without server authorization.

---

# 76. FINANCIAL DATA SECURITY

Salary information is highly sensitive.

Use:

```text
Least privilege
Strict authorization
Audit logs
Secure API responses
Secure PDF access
Encrypted storage where appropriate
```

Avoid logging complete salary data unnecessarily.

