# 91. PAYROLL UI/UX

The UI must be:

```text
Modern
Responsive
Professional
Fast
Accessible
Mobile-friendly
```

Use the existing AxonTimeHR design system.

Do not introduce a completely unrelated visual design.

---

# 92. PAYROLL PROCESSING TABLE

Show:

```text
Employee
Basic
Gross
Earnings
Deductions
LOP
Overtime
Tax
Net
Status
Exception
```

Allow authorized users to inspect details.

---

# 93. EMPLOYEE PAYROLL DETAIL

Clicking an employee should show:

```text
Attendance Summary
Leave Summary
Salary Components
Earnings
Deductions
Tax
Employer Contributions
Net Salary
Calculation Breakdown
```

This is critical for payroll transparency.

---

# 94. CALCULATION BREAKDOWN

Provide a clear explanation:

```text
Basic Salary
₹40,000

HRA
40% × Basic
₹16,000

Gross
₹65,000

LOP
2 days
-₹4,333

PF
₹4,800

Net
₹55,867
```

The exact values must come from the calculation engine.

---

# 95. PAYROLL EXPLANATION

Employees should understand why salary changed.

Display:

```text
Previous Month
Current Month
Difference
Reason
```

Example:

```text
Net Salary Difference: +₹5,000

Reason:
Salary revision
```

---

# 96. MONTH-TO-MONTH COMPARISON

Create:

```text
Current Month
Previous Month
Change
```

for:

```text
Gross
Deductions
Net
LOP
Overtime
Bonus
```

