# 97. NOTIFICATIONS

Use existing notification infrastructure.

Events:

```text
Payroll Processed
Payroll Approved
Payroll Locked
Payslip Generated
Payslip Available
Payroll Adjustment Approved
```

Do not build another notification engine.

---

# 98. EMAIL

Where supported:

```text
Payslip Available
Payroll Completed
```

Do not send salary information in insecure plain email bodies.

Prefer secure authenticated links.

---

# 99. BACKGROUND JOBS

Potential jobs:

```text
process_payroll
generate_payslips
send_payslip_notifications
generate_payroll_report
payroll_reconciliation
```

Jobs must be idempotent.

